            <ArticleTitle>Sickle cell disease: taking a multidisciplinary approach.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A costly major public health concern, sickle cell disease (SCD) affects up to 100,000 Americans and can cause life-threatening complications. This article reviews the pathophysiology, signs and symptoms, diagnostic testing, management, and treatment of patients with SCD.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
